flowchart TD
    Start([Loan Application Started])

    Profile[Profile & OTP Completed]
    KYC[KYC Verification]
    Income[Income & Employment Check]
    Bureau[Bureau Check]
    Eligibility[Eligibility Evaluation]

    RejectKYC([Loan Rejected])
    RejectIncome([Loan Rejected])
    RejectBureau([Loan Rejected])
    RejectEligibility([Loan Rejected])

    End([Loan Application Closed])

    Start --> Profile
    Profile --> KYC

    KYC -->|Failed| RejectKYC
    KYC -->|Passed| Income

    Income -->|Failed| RejectIncome
    Income -->|Passed| Bureau

    Bureau -->|Failed| RejectBureau
    Bureau -->|Passed| Eligibility

    Eligibility -->|Failed| RejectEligibility
    Eligibility -->|Passed| End

    RejectKYC --> End
    RejectIncome --> End
    RejectBureau --> End
    RejectEligibility --> End
